      "relation": "catalog_work_descriptions",
      "after_row": {
        "text": "Skye O’Malley builds a life that takes her far beyond her Irish beginnings. Love, family and the demands of a shipping enterprise pull her into dangerous conflicts. Her journeys carry her to Algiers and London, where private ambitions meet the power of the English crown. Skye’s determination brings her into opposition with Queen Elizabeth I. This historical romance follows her attempts to protect the people and independence she values while pursuing a future of her own.",
